#: ../../source/notebooks/7. Creating Custom Data Source.ipynb:9 a
#: fb0bb8de41c44b51822db8e741b514fe
msgid "Creating a Custom Data Source"
msgstr "自定义数据"

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. 3c970f0e415244278076300201670f80 Creating Custom
#: Data Source.ipynb:11 a
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** comes with pre-built `DataSources "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.DataSource>`__"
" for `Yahoo Finance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__,"
" `Alpaca "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.Alpaca>`__,"
" and `AKShare <https://github.com/akfamily/akshare>`__ that you can use "
"right away. If you have specific needs or want to use a different data "
"provider, you can create your own ``DataSource`` class."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker** 自带了为 `Yahoo Finance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.DataSource>`__、`Alpaca"
" "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.Alpaca>`__"
" 和 `AKShare <https://github.com/akfamily/akshare>`__ 构建的 `DataSource "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.DataSource>`__，你可以立即使用。如果你有特定需求或想使用其他数据提供商，你可以创建自己的"
" ``DataSource`` 类。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. Creating Custom Data Source.ipynb:15 a
#: e2391654dd8744c48e87d4bb32614b78
msgid "Extending DataSource"
msgstr "扩展 DataSource"

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. 4880ec7102e149ab815ba1b389cd2299 Creating Custom
#: Data Source.ipynb:17 a
msgid ""
"The following example implements a custom ``CSVDataSource`` to load data "
"from a CSV file. It reads a file named ``prices.csv`` into a `Pandas "
"DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__:"
msgstr ""
"以下示例实现了一个自定义的 ``CSVDataSource``，用于从 CSV 文件加载数据。它将名为 ``prices.csv`` 的文件读取到"
" `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"中："

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. 8b6c18d04e1947c784216297f85f4707 Creating Custom
#: Data Source.ipynb:53 a
msgid ""
"To make the custom ``'rsi'`` column from the CSV file available to "
"**PyBroker**, register it using `pybroker.register_columns "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.scope.html#pybroker.scope.register_columns>`__."
" This allows **PyBroker** to use the custom column when processing the "
"data."
msgstr ""
"为了使 CSV 文件中自定义的 ``'rsi'`` 列对 **PyBroker** 可用，我们使用 "
"`pybroker.register_columns "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.scope.html#pybroker.scope.register_columns>`__"
" 进行注册。这允许 **PyBroker** 在处理数据时使用这个自定义列。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. 165749a9e648461787386c5f265c4a84 Creating Custom
#: Data Source.ipynb:55 a
msgid ""
"When returning data from your custom ``DataSource``, it must include the "
"columns expected by **PyBroker**: ``symbol``, ``date``, ``open``, "
"``high``, ``low``, and ``close``."
msgstr ""
"从自定义 ``DataSource`` 返回数据时，必须包含 **PyBroker** "
"所需的列：``symbol``、``date``、``open``、``high``、``low`` 和 ``close``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. Creating Custom Data Source.ipynb:57 a
#: c995d70ae64841f9b3a32dde70454143
msgid "Now we can query the CSV data from an instance of ``CSVDataSource``:"
msgstr "现在我们可以从 ``CSVDataSource`` 的一个实例查询 CSV 数据："

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. Creating Custom Data Source.ipynb:368 a
#: f435e75654494b238eac795259944c69
msgid ""
"To use ``CSVDataSource`` in a backtest, we create a new `Strategy "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy>`__"
" object and pass it the custom ``DataSource``:"
msgstr ""
"要在回测中使用 ``CSVDataSource``，我们创建一个新的 `Strategy "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy>`__"
" 对象，并传入自定义的 ``DataSource``："

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. Creating Custom Data Source.ipynb:655 a
#: d48d0252609b4c2495b88543c2c3a1d0
msgid ""
"Because we registered the custom ``rsi`` column with **PyBroker**, it can"
" be accessed in the `ExecContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext>`__"
" using ``ctx.rsi``."
msgstr ""
"因为我们已经使用 **PyBroker** 注册了自定义的 ``rsi`` 列，所以可以在 `ExecContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext>`__"
" 中使用 ``ctx.rsi`` 来访问它。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. 09f376871b5b4948b0cb31284336da32 Creating Custom
#: Data Source.ipynb:667 a
msgid "Using a Pandas DataFrame"
msgstr "使用 Pandas DataFrame"

#: ../../source/notebooks/7. 0904e2e4cad44404b0ceab2334b985b7 Creating Custom
#: Data Source.ipynb:669 a
msgid ""
"If you do not need the flexibility of implementing your own `DataSource "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.DataSource>`__,"
" you can pass a `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"to a ``Strategy`` instead."
msgstr ""
"如果你不需要实现自己的 `DataSource "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.DataSource>`__"
" 的灵活性，可以将 `Pandas DataFrame "
"<https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/reference/api/pandas.DataFrame.html>`__ "
"传递给 ``Strategy``。"

